# Source code language

Mandatory. All source code must be in **English**: identifiers, file names, packages, comments, commit-oriented technical terms, enum values, CSS classes, and API field names.

Do not use Spanish or Spanglish in code.

User-visible UI copy stays in **Spanish**, sentence case, as defined in the UI copy rule.
